    <Prose>The full Jacobi construction follows the <a href="https://www.cs.utexas.edu/~flame/laff/alaff/chapter11-Jacobi-rotation.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">UT Austin rotation derivation</a> and <a href="https://www.cs.utexas.edu/~flame/laff/alaff/chapter11-Jacobi-method-spectral-decomposition.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">spectral-decomposition development</a>, with an explicitly stated sign convention and scaled stopping rule. <a href="https://textbooks.math.gatech.edu/ila/eigenvectors.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Interactive Linear Algebra</a> supplies a second written geometric treatment. <a href="https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.linalg.eigh.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SciPy generalized eigh</a> specifies its SPD second matrix and mass normalization. The inspected passages and historical Pearson principal-axis reading are recorded in this topic's research receipt; no source drawing was copied.</Prose>
